WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.220
Magic Knight Rayearth
I, Umi Ryuuzaki, along with
Hikaru Shidou and Fuu Hououji...

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.580
I, Umi Ryuuzaki, along with
Hikaru Shidou and Fuu Hououji...

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.140
...was summoned back
to the world called Cephiro.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:19.230
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:22.490
...and was facing total destruction.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:27.530
Approaching from Chizeta, one
of the countries invading Cephiro...

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:33.100
...was Bravada, the mobile fortress
of the twin princesses Tarta and Tatra.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:39.700
Tarta and Tatra requested a serious
duel with me, and I faced them.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:44.310
They promised to retreat
from Cephiro if I won.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:48.710
I believed their words, so I fought
them and managed to win.

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:53.020
We were able
to reconcile with Chizeta...

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.060
...but there are other enemies.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:59.970
Hikaru, Fuu,
let's do our best together.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:08.000
I feel it trembling
in the bottom of my heart...

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.810
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:18.210
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:24.390
And my love, full of pride,
comes to life right in front of me.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:32.430
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:34.870
The warm, red
shades of the sunset...

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.430
...have a melancholy beauty.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:45.610
Solitary tears fall into
the sea that I sealed away...

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:49.380
...inside my heart.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:53.610
The bright light that I missed
will not come back to me.

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:59.890
So I want freedom, just like the wind
that will come with the next sunrise.

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:07.560
I feel it trembling in
the bottom of my heart...

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:12.240
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:17.740
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:21.920
Someday I want to find for myself...

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:28.110
...a future that has no end.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:37.090
Desperate Situation!
Crisis Upon Lantis

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.180
I don't think
Cephiro's current system...

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:58.120
...where the Pillar puts
everything on her shoulders...

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.420
...is correct at all.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.420
I agree.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:07.900
Master Mage!

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:12.830
Cephiro was beautiful
once upon a time.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:17.340
There was no strife,
no natural disasters...

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.640
Everyone lived happily.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:28.040
That beautiful Cephiro was created
and upheld by Princess Emeraude...

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.850
...by the heart of one girl.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:36.250
However, something has
long been on my mind.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:40.190
Who protects
the happiness of that girl?

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:48.360
Cephiro is a land
for everyone who lives there.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:54.870
And the person who will
determine the fate of this country...

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.570
...is you.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:22.940
Princess Emeraude...

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.430
Lantis, answer me.

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:32.980
For what reason
did you leave Cephiro?

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:37.410
Why did you return after
Princess Emeraude was eradicated?

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:43.250
To bring an end to
the Pillar system of Cephiro.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.590
Zagato truly loved
Princess Emeraude.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.700
Even though he knew
it would never be allowed.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:56.440
Furthermore, Princess Emeraude
was in love with Zagato as well.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:01.610
However, their wishes
were not the same.

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:05.040
Even if it sacrificed
everything in this world...

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.450
...Zagato wanted freedom
for Princess Emeraude's heart.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:13.820
And Princess Emeraude denied herself
freedom at the expense of others...

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.960
...and chose eradication.

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:24.630
If this system that relies solely on
the Pillar for everything goes on...

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:28.500
...a tragedy like Princess
Emeraude's will happen again.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:32.930
Tragedy should never be repeated.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:06.300
I cherish every
person living in Cephiro.

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:12.650
All the more if they are pupils who
I tended to and guided personally.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.810
Princess Emeraude...

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.410
Zagato...

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.380
Alcyone...

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:22.420
And of course you.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.120
Lantis...

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:29.690
Never again do I want
to see anyone's heart...

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:34.060
...torn apart from the heavy
responsibilities of the Pillar.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.100
Master Mage...

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:42.540
The teary faces of the Magic
Knights were especially painful.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.350
If we had found the next Pillar...

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:53.890
...I intended to reveal everything
about Princess Emeraude's tragedy.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.660
Why the princess was eradicated...

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:12.540
Why the Magic Knights
were summoned...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.170
Everything about
that sorrowful legend.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:23.480
Even if it meant the candidate would
refuse to become the next Pillar.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.730
It's all right. Don't worry.

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:43.700
Right.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.100
Ms. Umi!

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:49.330
Fuu!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.040
Are you unhurt?

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:57.470
I'm all right.
In any case, I'll introduce you.

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:01.970
These are the two
princesses of Chizeta.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.650
It's all right. They understand.

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:10.950
Hello, I am Tatra of Chizeta.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.490
I'm Tarta.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.730
Now, Tarta.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.230
Don't be bashful.
Introduce yourself properly.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.960
Sister...

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:24.000
I'm sorry. Tarta is a very shy girl.

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.840
I-I see...

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.970
But as promised...

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.540
Chizeta definitely will
not invade Cephiro now.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.480
You're pretty good, Umi.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:39.010
It was because
they were both good people.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:43.250
Pullin' like that...
What if my face stretches out?

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:47.560
Oh, it's definitely better
if it stretches rather than not.

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:49.100
What for?

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:53.660
I also believe it is better
that it stretches than not.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.070
Huh?

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:59.970
If you are able to do something,
it may come in handy someday.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.270
That's right.

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:05.340
She might encounter
a cheek-stretching contest...

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:07.810
...at some point in the future.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.140
Of course.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.180
Right?

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.320
T-They seem to be getting along well.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.580
Y-Yeah.

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:28.440
I am Aska of Fahren!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.560
The dragon of Fahren?

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.170
Ms. Aska...

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.020
I will go!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.120
Fuu!

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:57.590
I have not come here to fight!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.120
What?

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:11.610
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:17.610
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.130
Ms. Aska.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.610
I... well...

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:47.540
Lady Aska...

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:53.750
I have stopped fighting.

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:55.820
Oh!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:12:01.190
It is impossible for me
to always think about Cephiro.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.770
After I heard Fuu's story,
I thought about it thoroughly.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.130
I must rule over Fahren.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:12.330
Therefore, I have
given up on Cephiro.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.480
Thank you
very much for understanding.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:28.550
All is well, isn't it, Lady Aska?

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:29.920
W-Well...

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:33.220
I came today to fulfill our promise.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.420
Promise?

00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:37.490
Our promise to have tea.

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.460
You remembered!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.370
Of course!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.330
And that is why you
came all the way here?

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:49.380
Did I trouble you by doing so?

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:52.780
No.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:55.480
I am happy that you did.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:00.080
Can I call you Fuu?

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.450
Of course!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.420
Yay!

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:04.930
Fuu...

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.120
Fuu...
Yes?

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.740
The crown room...

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:30.450
Only one who is qualified
may enter that room!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:34.150
I know.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:39.090
That's why I'm going to test
myself and see if I'm qualified.

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:42.490
Stop!

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:46.200
You can't! Eagle!

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:10.560
Only those qualified to become the
Pillar may leave the crown room alive.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:17.560
Back then, I'm sure Hikaru and I
entered that room simultaneously.

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:34.580
Then why were both of us able
to come out of the room safely?

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.840
Is it Eagle?

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.150
Is it Hikaru?

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:48.660
This means that one
of us can become the Pillar.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.830
Me, the Pillar?

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:58.770
There's no problem
if I'm the one qualified to be the Pillar.

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:02.070
However, if it's Hikaru...

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:04.710
Lantis...

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:10.210
You might have fallen
in love with the next Pillar.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.450
Just like your elder brother...

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:54.520
What'll you do if you're the one
who can be the Pillar, Hikaru?

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.760
Nova?

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:05.470
I know what you think
about the Pillar, Hikaru.

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.320
It...

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.450
...protected me.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.440
Everyone... Everyone gets in
the way of me playing with Hikaru!

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:35.830
Seville!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.460
Alba!

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:53.350
I hate everyone Hikaru loves.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:58.350
If everyone that Hikaru loves
goes away, Hikaru will be alone.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:01.050
She'll play with me and only me.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:02.590
Lantis...

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.730
I hate him!

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:09.490
Wait, Nova!

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.210
I am you, Hikaru.

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:19.440
So I will make Lantis mine!

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.340
Nova!

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.080
This presence...

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:40.570
This room is protected by
a barrier made by Master Mage Clef.

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:42.430
I am Hikaru.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:46.000
Whatever Hikaru can
pass through, I can too.

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:52.840
Are you a shadow
created by Hikaru's heart?

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:31.310
Here, we can fight
without anyone bothering us.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:54.200
Lightning Bolt Onslaught!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.610
You're strong.

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:07.650
Lantis!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:09.750
Master Mage...

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:14.320
Only you were drawn into the alternate
dimension created by that girl!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:21.790
I tried to break into
her dimension, but I can't!

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.640
Even you can't break through?

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:28.040
That's not it!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:31.200
That girl was likely
created by Hikaru's heart.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:34.010
She is part of Hikaru's heart.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:39.140
If I break through the dimensional wall,
the girl who created it may be hurt!

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.990
Then if I injure that girl...

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.930
Hikaru's heart will be hurt.

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:56.440
If that girl dies, a part of
Hikaru will be forever lost!

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:01.330
Hikaru...

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.000
Flame Arrow!

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:41.180
Get out of my way!

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:00.590
Lantis...

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:13.270
Hey, you're stronger than this, right?
Why aren't you fighting seriously?

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:16.980
Is it because Hikaru
will be hurt if I'm hurt?

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:42.400
Hikaru...

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:51.680
He's mine, Hikaru!

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:03.630
Lantis!

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:20.510
Shine someday.
Believing is just that.

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:30.020
Because it gives me
the courage to live on now.

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:38.190
Blown by the winds of the ages.

00:22:39.570 --> 00:22:44.660
Groping around for tomorrow.

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:52.770
Darkness spreads,
and only worries...

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:59.480
...keep welling up.

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:07.520
I will definitely find bright feelings...

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:14.230
...when I get over the sea of tears.

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:23.540
Someday I will find it,
and the unyielding future...

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:32.850
...will lead dreams
to a world full of light.

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:49.060
I am Aska, royal princess of Fahren!

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:53.140
I'm happy you could become
friends with the Magic Knights.

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:55.970
The tea Fuu makes is delicious!

00:23:56.080 --> 00:24:00.070
For Fuu's sake,
I will fight to protect Cephiro too!

00:24:00.180 --> 00:24:03.150
Right! Next time on
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:07.780
Hikaru in Shock! The Truth
About Nova. You have to watch it!

00:24:07.890 --> 00:24:09.420
But who is Nova?

00:24:09.420 --> 00:24:10.420
Hikaru in Shock!
The Truth About Nova
But who is Nova?

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:13.430
Hikaru in Shock!
The Truth About Nova

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:20.300
Who is it today?

00:24:21.340 --> 00:24:23.330
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:23.440 --> 00:24:29.400
Look forward to the next episode!
